 * play, plus, minus, external, gauge, file, users, calendar, send, download, thermometer, layers.
 * Brand glyphs (whatsapp, facebook) from Simple Icons (CC0).
 *
 * Directional icons (arrow, chevron-*, external, send) are mirrored automatically on RTL pages.
 */
